==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|hematology|cytology|lang=en}} A small colorless disk-shaped particle found in the blood of [[mammal]]s, which plays an important role in the formation of [[blood clot]]s.

====Synonyms====
* [[blood platelet]]
* [[thrombocyte]]

====Derived terms====
* [[proplatelet]]

